   "text": "Trinity Western University (Undergraduate) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nTrinity Western University (Undergraduate)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nFounded in 1962, Trinity Western University is a global Christian liberal arts university. We are dedicated to equipping students to discover meaningful connections between careers, life, and the needs of the world. Drawing upon the riches of the Christian tradition, seeking to unite faith and reason through teaching and scholarship, Trinity Western University is a degree-granting research institution offering liberal arts and sciences as well as professional schools in business, nursing, education, human kinetics, graduate studies, and arts, media, and culture. With a student population from 90 different countries we have three locations in Canada: Langley, Richmond (Lansdowne & Minoru locations), and the Laurentian Leadership Centre in Ottawa. \nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 12:09\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n26/03/2026 12:09\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nCanada\nYearly Fees\nMax: CA$22,260.00\nMin: CA$22,260.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n60%\n3,000 of 5,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1962\nCampus(es)\nLangley\nCountry\nCanada\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/09/2025\nContract End Date\n31/08/2028\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.twu.ca/life-twu/housing-dining\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.twu.ca/admissions-aid/scholarships-financial-aid\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/user/TrinityWesternU\nInternship Details\nhttps://www.twu.ca/biotechnolog